  "Choices Type": "text",
  "Correct Answer": "B",
  "Solution": "One mile contains \\(8\\) furlongs, and each furlong contains \\(40\\) rods. Thus one mile contains \\(8\\) groups of \\(40\\) rods:\n\\[\n8\\cdot40=320.\n\\]\nThe answer is \\(\\boxed{320}\\) rods, choice B.",
